2026-07-26T10:39:33.2214911Z i /tmp/Rtmpiref0N/duckdb
2026-07-26T10:39:33.2215369Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-26T10:39:33.2216189Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-26T10:39:33.2216671Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-26T10:39:33.2217631Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-26T10:39:33.2218662Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-26T10:39:33.2219431Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
